{"quest_id": 6577, "name": "魔を宿す少女", "description": "魔物退治を行っていた王子たちは、\n苦しげに森をさまよう少女と遭遇する。\n\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "event": "降魔の復讐者", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920115, "map_no": 5477, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "exp": 150, "gold": 600, "drops": [{"item": 5002, "c": 1}, {"item": 1001, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 24, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097184, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 2, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "base_hp": 640, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 65, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 650.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097216, "master_id": 4, "spawn_sec": 22}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 8000, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 8000, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 15, "attack_interval": 81, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2115936, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 227, "master_id": 31277, "global_id": 4896, "spawn_sec": 41}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 5000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 5000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 156, "move_speed": 370.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097792, "master_id": 9, "spawn_sec": 73}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "魔物退治も一段落つきましたね。\n王子、一度休憩をとりましょうか。"}, {"name": "ソーマ", "text": "このあたり、普段は魔物が少ないはずなのに、\n今日はいったいどうしたんでしょうか……。", "face": "u23"}, {"name": "バシラ", "text": "例えば……近くに強力な魔物が現れて、\n住処を追われてきた、とかでしょうか？", "face": "u28"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "可能性として、無いとは言い切れませんね。\n警戒を怠らないように……っと、おや？　あれは……。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "――ハァ……ハァ……。\nぐっ……あぁあっ……！", "face": "u679"}, {"name": "ソーマ", "text": "王子！　向こうに人がいます！", "face": "u23"}, {"name": "アリサ", "text": "あの人、何だかふらふらしてませんか？\nあ、あのー！　大丈夫ですかー！？", "face": "u24"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "……ッ！　来ルナッ！\n私ニ……近寄ルナッ……！！", "face": "u679"}, {"name": "アリサ", "text": "あんな苦しそうなのに……。\nやっぱり放っておけません！\n王子、私あの人の後を――", "face": "u24"}, {"name": "カゲロウ", "text": "――待て。\n魔物の残党が接近している。\n先にそちらを掃討せねば、あの娘も危ないだろう。", "face": "u139"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "時間をかけるわけにはいきませんね。\n王子、急いで魔物を迎撃しましょう！", "face": "l2fe133ccbf94"}]}, {"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 46, "lines": [{"name": "？？？", "text": "アァ……グァアッ……！", "face": "u679"}, {"name": "アリサ", "text": "さっきの子が！\n今こっちに来たら危ないですよ！！", "face": "u24"}, {"name": "バシラ", "text": "いえ……待ってください！\nあの子の後ろ、魔物が居ますよ！？", "face": "u28"}, {"name": "バルバストラフ", "text": "どうやら魔物に取り付かれているようじゃな。\nこの魔力、おそらく手傷を与えると、\nさらに凶暴になるぞ……！！", "face": "u63"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "？？？", "text": "…………ハァ……ハァ。\n……何故、助けた。", "face": "u679"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "どうやら正気に戻ったようですね。\nしかしこの気配、魔物は取り付いたままですか……。\n今は落ち着いているようですが……。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………。", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子！？　不用意に近付いては……！！", "face": "l2fe133ccbf94"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "……貴様は一体……？\n私を恐れない、とは……。……くっ、うぅ。", "face": "u679"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………！", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "アリサ", "text": "酷く衰弱してるみたいです……。\n王子、そのまま支えてあげてください。\nあの、歩けますか？", "face": "u24"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "他人の肩を借りるなど……。\n……一人で、歩ける。", "face": "u679"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "……どうやら、大丈夫なようですね。\nひとまず、詳しい話を聞くことにしましょうか。", "face": "l2fe133ccbf94"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920115_5477", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 889, "y": 295}, {"k": "m", "x": 717, "y": 308, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 583, "y": 303, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 566, "y": 221, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 498, "y": 201, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 419, "y": 191, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 335, "y": 187, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 262, "y": 226, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 522, "y": 408, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 445, "y": 415, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 369, "y": 412, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 281, "y": 362, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 238, "y": 287, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 148, "y": 270, "id": 212}, {"k": "r", "x": 657, "y": 262, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 627, "y": 376, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 501, "y": 271, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 415, "y": 241, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 337, "y": 258, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 343, "y": 312, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 413, "y": 343, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 495, "y": 339, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 538, "y": 159, "id": 308}, {"k": "r", "x": 462, "y": 142, "id": 309}, {"k": "r", "x": 387, "y": 135, "id": 310}, {"k": "r", "x": 298, "y": 137, "id": 311}, {"k": "r", "x": 195, "y": 209, "id": 312}, {"k": "r", "x": 391, "y": 471, "id": 313}, {"k": "r", "x": 245, "y": 413, "id": 314}, {"k": "r", "x": 199, "y": 361, "id": 315}]}, "start_cost": 10, "active": true, "name_en": "The Girl Who Bears Evil", "description_en": "The Princes, out hunting Monsters, encounter a Girl wandering the forest in distress. Beginner (Guide for earning 1★: Avg Lv1, 5 units deployed)"}